&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In a world where &amp;ldquo;demon beasts&amp;rdquo; from another world appear, a &amp;ldquo;demon extermination organization&amp;rdquo; is formed to eliminate them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After a certain mission, the organization&amp;rsquo;s strongest demon exorcist, Tatsuya Nikaidō, goes missing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;His girlfriend, Rei Suzushiro (the heroine), decides to become an exorcist herself in order to search for her missing lover. She throws herself into the battle against the demon beasts.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>